## Problem

Azure AI Foundry (and other OpenAI-compatible proxies) that host DeepSeek or other reasoning models reject **any unknown request field**, including `thinking: {type: "disabled"}` that openclaw unconditionally sends when a model has `reasoning: true` — even when `thinkingDefault` is `"off"`.

Error from Azure:
```
400 Unrecognized request argument supplied: thinking
```

This causes every request to the model to fail and fall through the entire fallback chain, making the proxy unusable as a primary model.

## Root cause

In `openai-completions.ts`, when `compat.thinkingFormat === "deepseek"` and `model.reasoning === true`, openclaw always injects a `thinking` param — even with `reasoningEffort` unset, it sends `thinking: { type: "disabled" }`. Azure's DeepSeek-V4-Pro endpoint treats this as an unrecognized field.

There is no config option to tell openclaw "this model is a reasoning model but hosted on a proxy that does not accept the `thinking` param — skip all thinking param injection."

## Fix

Add `"none"` as a valid `thinkingFormat` value that acts as an explicit no-op: skip all thinking/reasoning param injection regardless of `model.reasoning`.

**`src/config/types.models.ts`** — adds `"none"` to `SupportedThinkingFormat` and `MODEL_THINKING_FORMATS` so it passes config validation.

**`src/llm/providers/openai-completions.ts`** — adds a guard at the top of the thinking injection block:

```typescript
if (compat.thinkingFormat === "none") {
  // Provider opted out of thinking param injection — skip entirely.
} else if (compat.thinkingFormat === "zai" && model.reasoning) {
  ...
```

## Usage

Set `compat.thinkingFormat: "none"` on any custom provider model that rejects thinking params:

```json
{
  "models": {
    "providers": {
      "azure": {
        "baseUrl": "https://my-resource.services.ai.azure.com/openai/v1",
        "api": "openai-completions",
        "models": [
          {
            "id": "DeepSeek-V4-Pro",
            "name": "Azure DeepSeek V4 Pro",
            "contextWindow": 1024000,
            "maxTokens": 131072,
            "compat": { "thinkingFormat": "none" }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## Tested

Confirmed on Azure AI Foundry (`donalolololo-resource`) with DeepSeek-V4-Pro — requests succeed after setting `thinkingFormat: "none"`.

Co-authored-by: Felix Lim <limfelix16@gmail.com>
